'''Mirror'''{{Unofficial}} is a niche [[Spells|spell]] with an unconfirmed effect.

==Description==
The Casting Seal contains a four satellite circles outside of the main ring. Each one contains a single [[Signs#Reflection|Sign of Reflection]]. An additional four Signs of Reflection are evenly spaced inside of the ring. Four [[Signs#Projection|Signs of Projection]] are placed next to each inner Sign of Reflection. 

It it currently unknown what effect this spell has on its own. It is only used for the [[contraption]] [[Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade]], layered atop of the [[Borrowshade Cloak|Borrowshade]] spell to create [[Mirror Cloak Spell|Borrowshade Mirror]]. Borrowshade is known to conceal the form and cloak it in shadow, while Borrowshade Mirror additionally projects the reflected image of a nearby beast. This additional effect is caused by Mirror, however, it is unclear what the spell would do on its own, given that the Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade relies on the reflective scales on the cloak in order for the spell to create the illusion.

==Usage==
: ''See [[Mirror Cloak Spell|Borrowshade Mirror]] or [[Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade]] for additional usage''
Mirror is layered with Borrowshade to create Borrowshade Mirror, which is used for the Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade contraption. [[Euini]] crosses out the Mirror part of the spell to create his [[Cloak of Borrowshade]].{{Ref|m|21|22}}{{Ref|a|12}}

